Paul Martin and Heather Baker of the Vancouver Rotary Club donated $10,000 towards the Kenya shipment in memory of Verona Edelstein, who was the Canadian High Commissioner to the Congo.

The Rotary Club of Langley also provided $5,000 in support of this shipment.
